  {
    "episode_id": 45125,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/5/45125.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "Well, hey, I wanted to just dig right into some of the whirlwind a couple of weeks we've had in Washington, of course, the impeachment hearings, which have just kind of been kind of like what I view as a circus almost. It's just hard to follow. There's so much information. I just want to get your thoughts on what you thought of the hearings and does this really do anything as far as moving forward with an impeachment process in Congress and in the Senate too?",
